name formal-grammar
category Package
revision 61955
shortdesc Typeset formal grammars
longdesc This package provides a new environment and associated commands
longdesc to typeset BNF grammars. It allows to easily write formal
longdesc grammars. Its original motivation was to typeset grammars for
longdesc beamer presentations, therefore, there are macros to emphasize
longdesc or downplay some parts of the grammar (which is the main
longdesc novelty compared to other BNF packages).
